[{:db/id "eec84841-0dae-5761-b467-ce2eb2342da7" :answer/id #uuid "eec84841-0dae-5761-b467-ce2eb2342da7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-36,\\,9,\\,168⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "19302086-6cf1-5118-9c0d-909000840d68" :answer/id #uuid "19302086-6cf1-5118-9c0d-909000840d68" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-12,\\,0,\\,96⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5aea8fe7-71be-55cc-b3e6-e7535c8fb3b7" :answer/id #uuid "5aea8fe7-71be-55cc-b3e6-e7535c8fb3b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨8,\\,57,\\,-32⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "07f3c848-dbff-5f1b-ad1b-23f4831d8ffd" :answer/id #uuid "07f3c848-dbff-5f1b-ad1b-23f4831d8ffd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨12,\\,-9,\\,24⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0c89cfd6-cb3c-558c-a04b-8bfe30bf8644" :answer/id #uuid "0c89cfd6-cb3c-558c-a04b-8bfe30bf8644" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨24,\\,-9,\\,-72⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7288ecef-567e-595a-b90c-71125b365b2d" :answer-field/id #uuid "7288ecef-567e-595a-b90c-71125b365b2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["eec84841-0dae-5761-b467-ce2eb2342da7" "19302086-6cf1-5118-9c0d-909000840d68" "5aea8fe7-71be-55cc-b3e6-e7535c8fb3b7" "07f3c848-dbff-5f1b-ad1b-23f4831d8ffd" "0c89cfd6-cb3c-558c-a04b-8bfe30bf8644"] :answer-field/correct "07f3c848-dbff-5f1b-ad1b-23f4831d8ffd" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "5a68d13f-8399-5ff1-b774-b1b84a373282" :question/id #uuid "5a68d13f-8399-5ff1-b774-b1b84a373282" :question/problem "Find the value of $(3h(t) - 2g(t))^{′}$ at $t = 2$, if\n$h(t)= ⟨2 t^{2},\\,9 - 3 t,\\,- 2 t^{3} - 16⟩; g(t)= ⟨t \\left(t + 2\\right),\\,-24,\\,- 4 t^{3}⟩$" :question/worked-solution "Using the constant multiple rule and the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(3h(t)-2g(t))'=3h'(\\!t)-2g'(\\!t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2 t^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(9 - 3 t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(- 2 t^{3} - 16)⟩ \\\\ &=⟨4 t,\\,-3,\\,- 6 t^{2}⟩ \\\\ g'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t \\left(t + 2\\right)),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-24),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(- 4 t^{3})⟩ \\\\ &=⟨2 t + 2,\\,0,\\,- 12 t^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3h(t)-2g(t))'\\big|_{t=2}&=3h'(\\!2)-2g'(\\!2) \\\\ &=3\\left(⟨8,\\,-3,\\,-24⟩\\right)-2\\left(⟨6,\\,0,\\,-48⟩\\right) \\\\ &=\\left(⟨24,\\,-9,\\,-72⟩\\right)+\\left(⟨-12,\\,0,\\,96⟩\\right) \\\\ &=⟨12,\\,-9,\\,24⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["7288ecef-567e-595a-b90c-71125b365b2d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "105fc45b-d9aa-5647-8478-24ee897554e2" :answer/id #uuid "105fc45b-d9aa-5647-8478-24ee897554e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨36,\\,-3,\\,-36⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e4d46704-3cf7-544d-aa5b-932780b205a2" :answer/id #uuid "e4d46704-3cf7-544d-aa5b-932780b205a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨72,\\,-3,\\,108⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c18dca8f-f976-58fb-937e-0955da836ca5" :answer/id #uuid "c18dca8f-f976-58fb-937e-0955da836ca5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨24,\\,19,\\,48⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d09c0c53-ad7d-5a79-92c3-cda91d610220" :answer/id #uuid "d09c0c53-ad7d-5a79-92c3-cda91d610220" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-36,\\,0,\\,-144⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a392fa70-156d-57e7-82f2-0893b7b7ab65" :answer/id #uuid "a392fa70-156d-57e7-82f2-0893b7b7ab65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-108,\\,3,\\,-252⟩" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "230e9f4b-ec6e-5a43-aa1f-9d2f50c7feb0" :answer-field/id #uuid "230e9f4b-ec6e-5a43-aa1f-9d2f50c7feb0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["105fc45b-d9aa-5647-8478-24ee897554e2" "e4d46704-3cf7-544d-aa5b-932780b205a2" "c18dca8f-f976-58fb-937e-0955da836ca5" "d09c0c53-ad7d-5a79-92c3-cda91d610220" "a392fa70-156d-57e7-82f2-0893b7b7ab65"] :answer-field/correct "105fc45b-d9aa-5647-8478-24ee897554e2" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "531c6c00-7c33-51fe-bcdf-6ff4d87bd71d" :question/id #uuid "531c6c00-7c33-51fe-bcdf-6ff4d87bd71d" :question/problem "Find the value of $(3h(t) - 2g(t))^{′}$ at $t = 2$, if\n$h(t)= ⟨6 t^{2},\\,3 - t,\\,3 t^{3} + 24⟩; g(t)= ⟨3 t \\left(t + 2\\right),\\,-8,\\,6 t^{3}⟩$" :question/worked-solution "Using the constant multiple rule and the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(3h(t)-2g(t))'=3h'(\\!t)-2g'(\\!t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6 t^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3 - t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3 t^{3} + 24)⟩ \\\\ &=⟨12 t,\\,-1,\\,9 t^{2}⟩ \\\\ g'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3 t \\left(t + 2\\right)),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-8),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6 t^{3})⟩ \\\\ &=⟨6 t + 6,\\,0,\\,18 t^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3h(t)-2g(t))'\\big|_{t=2}&=3h'(\\!2)-2g'(\\!2) \\\\ &=3\\left(⟨24,\\,-1,\\,36⟩\\right)-2\\left(⟨18,\\,0,\\,72⟩\\right) \\\\ &=\\left(⟨72,\\,-3,\\,108⟩\\right)+\\left(⟨-36,\\,0,\\,-144⟩\\right) \\\\ &=⟨36,\\,-3,\\,-36⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["230e9f4b-ec6e-5a43-aa1f-9d2f50c7feb0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "86ed3a70-cdde-56de-b810-9899566e914d" :answer/id #uuid "86ed3a70-cdde-56de-b810-9899566e914d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 16 t\\,i- \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j+6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "66c548d2-02d8-5526-b8e1-1c99ae671173" :answer/id #uuid "66c548d2-02d8-5526-b8e1-1c99ae671173" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2 - 16 t)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} - \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ef7037f7-a559-5d3e-be45-91f41c699e27" :answer/id #uuid "ef7037f7-a559-5d3e-be45-91f41c699e27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(16 t + 2)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} + \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j- 12 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "19e97975-4c74-5507-b653-606d0d1bf2e4" :answer/id #uuid "19e97975-4c74-5507-b653-606d0d1bf2e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i+8 e^{4 t}\\,j- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "eed0e2f3-ee96-5a6d-a583-fb4c12616f63" :answer/id #uuid "eed0e2f3-ee96-5a6d-a583-fb4c12616f63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(- 8 t^{2} + 2 t - 10)\\,i+\\frac{2 \\left(\\left(t - 3\\right) e^{4 t} + 4\\right)}{t - 3}\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "468a0c5a-ad2b-5b7f-abac-b961a5396963" :answer-field/id #uuid "468a0c5a-ad2b-5b7f-abac-b961a5396963" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["86ed3a70-cdde-56de-b810-9899566e914d" "66c548d2-02d8-5526-b8e1-1c99ae671173" "ef7037f7-a559-5d3e-be45-91f41c699e27" "19e97975-4c74-5507-b653-606d0d1bf2e4" "eed0e2f3-ee96-5a6d-a583-fb4c12616f63"] :answer-field/correct "66c548d2-02d8-5526-b8e1-1c99ae671173" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "20b4dae3-6b9d-5ae1-bd0a-7100a3030dee" :question/id #uuid "20b4dae3-6b9d-5ae1-bd0a-7100a3030dee" :question/problem "Find the derivative of $-2f(t)+2g(t)$ with respect to $t$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t)&=(4 t^{2} + 1)\\,i- \\frac{4}{t - 3}\\,j+\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k \\\\ g(t)&=(t - 4)\\,i+e^{4 t}\\,j+\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the constant multiple rule and the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(-2f(t)+2g(t))'=-2f'(\\!t)+2g'(\\!t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4 t^{2} + 1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(- \\frac{4}{t - 3}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)})⟩ \\\\ &=8 t\\,i+\\frac{4}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k \\\\ g'(t)&=⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t - 4),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(e^{4 t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\cos{\\left(3 t \\right)})⟩ \\\\ &=1\\,i+4 e^{4 t}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-2f(t)+2g(t))'&=-2f'(\\!t)+2g'(\\!t) \\\\ &=-2\\left(8 t\\,i+\\frac{4}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right)+2\\left(1\\,i+4 e^{4 t}\\,j- 3 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right) \\\\ &=\\left(- 16 t\\,i- \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j+6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right)+\\left(2\\,i+8 e^{4 t}\\,j- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 t \\right)}\\,k\\right) \\\\ &=(2 - 16 t)\\,i+(8 e^{4 t} - \\frac{8}{\\left(t - 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["468a0c5a-ad2b-5b7f-abac-b961a5396963"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "1c3aff9f-c826-5930-ba16-3983961fdd31" :answer/id #uuid "1c3aff9f-c826-5930-ba16-3983961fdd31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(8 - 18 t^{2})\\,i+(4 e^{2 t} - \\frac{6}{\\left(t + 3\\right)^{2}})\\,j" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "838a64ec-997e-5f8b-96bd-2d63e5eac034" :answer/id #uuid "838a64ec-997e-5f8b-96bd-2d63e5eac034" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 18 t^{2}\\,i- \\frac{6}{\\left(t + 3\\right)^{2}}\\,j+8 \\sin{\\left(4 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "05042b03-df4c-5ccd-a964-8eaf6131a969" :answer/id #uuid "05042b03-df4c-5ccd-a964-8eaf6131a969" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\,i+4 e^{2 t}\\,j- 8 \\sin{\\left(4 t \\right)}\\,k" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "bf993974-3b0c-5c9f-886d-1d6ca421c69c" :answer/id #uuid "bf993974-3b0c-5c9f-886d-1d6ca421c69c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(18 t^{2} + 8)\\